                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Good afternoon. I came here today to purchase a TV that was advertised on sale in the newspaper. However, the price in the store is higher than in the ad.\\nB: Oh, I’m sorry. That specific sale ended yesterday. We do have other models that are being discounted, but they are smaller than the one you wanted.\\nA: Yes, I saw a few of them already, but I would like something similar to what I wanted. I think I’ll just visit some other stores and have a look around.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
